## Step 4: Live Network Interception Bypass (If needed)
If you try to route Waydroid's traffic through a proxy on your Linux host and the apps throw connection errors, they are actively enforcement-pinning their certificates.
To bypass this for testing purposes, you can inject a universal bypass script using Frida directly into your running Waydroid container:

# Connect host ADB to Waydroid
adb connect 192.168.240.112:5555
# Push Frida server to Waydroid and run it as root
adb root
adb push frida-server /data/local/tmp/
adb shell "chmod 755 /data/local/tmp/frida-server && /data/local/tmp/frida-server &"

